{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/778950ea49dc7740cc28e99f80fc646b.avif?t=1763940079\" width=1560 height=724 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where the lines between the living and the spirit world blur. Immerse yourself in a game that weaves together the mystical, the supernatural, and the struggles of everyday life during the turbulent final years of the Ming dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/b82fcd014b3916d403e20efa787f7c06.webp?t=1763940079\" width=614 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/763e924050735a4d72a75309fcacb06f.poster.avif?t=1763940079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/763e924050735a4d72a75309fcacb06f.webm?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/763e924050735a4d72a75309fcacb06f.mp4?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and intricate narrative based on nearly 500 &quot;marvel tales&quot; from <i>Strange Tales from a Chinese Studio</i>, a collection of classical Chinese stories by the Qing dynasty writer <i>Pu Songling</i>. Encounter spirits and mythical creatures, and live the life of people during the closing days of the Ming dynasty. Witness their struggles, hear their tales, and decide how you will shape their destiny in a world filled with intrigue, war, and mysticism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/1853bc4732695f474fe90cb508db0ad2.webp?t=1763940079\" width=614 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/352cc6b4d53081cf81393d4fd10f2b5c.poster.avif?t=1763940079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/352cc6b4d53081cf81393d4fd10f2b5c.webm?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/352cc6b4d53081cf81393d4fd10f2b5c.mp4?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a unique blend of classic turn-based RPG mechanics and dynamic card battling. The combination of randomness and strategy provides endless possibilities for combat and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/88e183efe92b1601b92df792e4345d0d.webp?t=1763940079\" width=614 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/083d521cbdf6f57abb0c32ccaee5b8b1.poster.avif?t=1763940079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/083d521cbdf6f57abb0c32ccaee5b8b1.webm?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/083d521cbdf6f57abb0c32ccaee5b8b1.mp4?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a party of characters, each with their own unique decks. Arrange your team strategically to build the perfect deck. Find unique cards through exploration, quests, and crafting. The more you play, the more options you\u2019ll have to customize and strengthen your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/2534f2e2261c0dcf7e5a4638b311b389.webp?t=1763940079\" width=614 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/fa6c5007c6559b611d6f15f30e6861cd.poster.avif?t=1763940079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/fa6c5007c6559b611d6f15f30e6861cd.webm?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/fa6c5007c6559b611d6f15f30e6861cd.mp4?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a living Chinese painting and dive into a harmonious blend of history and artistry. Let the beauty of classic Chinese art captivate your senses like never before as you explore and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3379860?t=1763940079","background_