RPG mechanics and dynamic card battling. The combination of randomness and strategy provides endless possibilities for combat and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/88e183efe92b1601b92df792e4345d0d.webp?t=1763940079\" width=614 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/083d521cbdf6f57abb0c32ccaee5b8b1.poster.avif?t=1763940079\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/083d521cbdf6f57abb0c32ccaee5b8b1.webm?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/083d521cbdf6f57abb0c32ccaee5b8b1.mp4?t=1763940079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a party of characters, each with their own unique decks. Arrange your team strategically to build the perfect deck. Find unique cards through exploration, quests, and crafting. The more you play, the more options you\u2019ll have to customize and strengthen your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379860/extras/2534f2e2261c0dcf7e5a4638b311b389.webp?t=1763940079\" width=614 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://